# DMS Frontend

- App Router (`demo/dms-ui/app/`). API base: `http://localhost:8000`.
- House style: near-black canvas, mono (JetBrains Mono) for data/code, zero border-radius, no chat bubbles.
- Tailwind: gradient-critical elements use inline `style`, not `bg-gradient-*` (purge risk).
- Role context: `context/RoleContext.jsx`. Reuse `ResultGrid`, `SqlBlock` for data display.
